    narr:narration """Quinton Fairweather has instituted a [new mandatory release gate](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1) for all Meridian deployments, requiring a signed manifest before shipping. This policy, [formally codified](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_3) and [scoped to staging and production](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_4), is presented as a direct response to [past security lapses](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_2) involving unsigned artifacts. Fairweather [asserts personal ownership](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_5) of this requirement, framing the gate as a necessary conservation measure to ensure deployment integrity.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_2> ;
